  "releaseNotes": "- Greatly expanded database column type support. Many types that were previously unsupported can now be saved and searched, and columns whose types the framework does not recognize are handled more gracefully.\n      - Added the DateTimeOffset field for timezone-aware date/time columns (e.g. Oracle TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE, SQL Server datetimeoffset).\n      - FileField can now store the file content directly in a database column instead of using file storage.\n      - Design check now detects more invalid references that previously passed unnoticed, such as list sort/search conditions, script event handlers, and layout names.",
